"1563 (and also one of the Three Forms of Unity, or Four Forms of Unity, "
"depending on the denomination).  The contents consists of 129 questions and "
"answers, divided into three main sections: guilt, grace, and gratitude.  Each"
" section addresses a different aspect of the Christian faith and is intended "
"to be memorized and understood by believers."
msgstr ""
